    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step away from the fight entirely\"... that is exactly it. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just stop existing within it. like, if the system has already erased me, what is there left to even hold onto? it just feels like the loop is infinite and there's no version of my life where this actually gets solved.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
